// Anti-Witchcraft Repositionable Bomb (enemy_1369_bmbcar1, PRTS 反巫术变位炸弹) and its carrier body
// (enemy_1370_bmbcar2). Sent by an Explosives Loading Point along its track toward a Bloodcalling Altar.
// - The bomb is NEUTRAL (`_sideTypeIndex` 2): enemies' ordinary selectors take it (record taunt 1, so before taunt-0
//   operators); operators never select it. Unblockable, UNBALANCE_IMMUNE, it never attacks.
// - SP 0 of 10 (PRTS): its speed is base x SP x `Passive.multiplier` (0.1), FINAL_SCALER, every 0.1 s; at 0 SP
//   (`MoveBackwards`, SP ratio 0) it is UNMOVABLE. Each damage it takes: -1 SP (`sp[self]` ON_TAKE_DAMAGE).
// - The carrier (side 1: enemy) follows it. Operators hit the carrier: `enemy_bmbcar2_sp[add]` cancels the damage and
//   gives the bomb +1 SP. `sp[ctrl]` each 1 s: 3 s without a carrier hit -1 SP, 6 s -2 SP.
// - Within 1.0 of a Bloodcalling Altar (the Altar's KillBmbcar) it casts Explosion: INVINCIBLE through the 2 s
//   `Explode` clip; at its OnAttack (1.13 s) ATK x10 True damage to every hostile enemy in its 1.7 attack radius; at
//   the cast end the Altar dies (`trap_bonore_kill[bmbcar]` -> ActiveOutset) and the bomb leaves (InstantKill).
// Every component reachable from the retained abilities and the templates are pinned below (as in
// enemy-talulah-features.js).
